              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Olivia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I LOVED IT!!! Not the most healthy but definitely a delicious snack to try when you are craving sugar. Personally I like using brioche bread instead of white and for the frosting you can make a cream cheese frosting by adding in some softened cream cheese to the mixture. The one problem was that they didn't stick together so I had to use toothpicks.",
