            },
            "reviewBody": "These are great. So versatile and we mix it up as well. We use tortillas with bananas and peanut butter or peanut we butter and jelly or butter and peanut butter or butter cinnamon and honey. Sometimes we use orange marmalade for an orange cinnamon roll. Very tasty for kiddos",
